<title>EGYPT: Egypt interbank o/n, one week rates fall.</title>
<headline>Egypt interbank o/n, one week rates fall.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The range of overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound fell on Thursday to 6 and 7-1/4 percent from Wednesday's range of 7 and 7-1/2 in a liquid private sector market, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates also widened to 6 and 7-1/4 percent from 7 and 7-1/2 percent on Wednesday, they said.</p>
<p>Bankers said that public sector banks kept their official minimum lending rate steady at 10-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
